    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank"> Earth and Environmental Sciences Travel Grant (Spring 2025)</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank">Cornerstone Undergraduate Research Award (Spring 2024) </a>
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank"> Professorial Assistantship (Fall 2023 - Spring 2025)</a>
    </li>

  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

